VMWeave-GPU evolved from a Flyt/Cricket-based Kubernetes GPU experiment.
This repository preserves the previous Flyt patches and RPC implementation in
legacy/rpc and develops a shared-memory runtime in runtime/shm. Flyt is
distributed under the MIT License and includes a CUDA API virtualization layer
derived from Cricket. Renaming the project does not change source attribution.

